<translate>
==== BandagePower ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The modifier affects how long the medical bandage stays clean, the ability to clear a burn, and the ability to apply the item as a bandage.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
BandagePower = 4,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

